       "after": "Expose wall and sleep-inclusive monotonic observations; do not decide trust time. Under the test-only crash-matrix feature only, observe_clock takes its wall reading from the crash barrier's scripted wall clock when the process is a matrix child with a clock script (law X9 r2 item 3, unit X9-1); its monotonic readings and boot identity stay native, and without the script or the feature the wall reading is the OS's."
