ence for X4's S6 predicate, and a fenced non-report read's S4 proposal for the write-ahead) or a refusal naming its law 468 item 6 row (TrustRow, including the host invariant row). The admission itself writes nothing. The file declares its macOS child modules floor_publication (X4T-b's write-ahead floor publication), live_observation (X4a's fenced operation read, retained handles and observation) and trust_bootstrap (X4B's first trust acceptance and its F-absent branch), and re-exports ConfirmedCurrent, fenced_operation_read, the live-observation types and BootstrapSource."
